A||||26||Fierochic88||Tech Day at the Gilbert's! October 6||||14||
Z||000000||Fierochic88||09-15-2001||08:15 PM||||Hey Everyone -<BR>    Well we've been passing the word by mouth and it's time to put it up on here.  It's that time of year for the second annual tech day at the Gilbert's!  The Tech Day will be held on Saturday, October 6 at our home in Oley, PA (near Reading - northwest of Philly).  The morning session will consist of a technical session regarding one of the following three topics:<P>1.)  Headliner Removal, Repair and Replacement (also includes trim removal, of course)<P>2.)  Air Conditioning Conversion to 134-A from R-12<P>3.)  Headlight Motor Rebuilding<P>Which topic we present is up to you!  So if everyone who is thinking of attending could let me know, we'll present the topic that recieves the most votes!  Just e-mail at FieroChic88@hotmail.com or my dad at jgilbert@talon.net.  You can even RSVP right on the forum!<P>Also, the afternoon session will be another road rally!  We promise that this year's road rally will be just as fun (but less confusing!) as last years!  Complete with prizes!  <P>Also, as a special bonus, as we did last year we will have a special giveaway raffle!  Everyone who attends will be entered in the drawing to win prizes!  Last year's prizes included Rodney Dickman manuels, free memberships & plenty of car care supplies!<P>Hope to see you there!<P>Jennifer<P>------------------<BR>IM Username:  FieroChic88<BR>Silver 1988 GT<BR>Silver 1986 2m4<BR>Cobalt Blue 85 GT<P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.webjolt.f2s.com/pictures/jenscar-sig1.jpg"> ||||reg||14
Z||000001||skitime||09-15-2001||09:02 PM||||Well, we are glad to be the first to respond that we will be there.  Dave & Vonnie<P>------------------<BR><UL TYPE=SQUARE><BR><LI>Red 88 GT T-TOP<BR><LI>Red 86 GT<BR></UL> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/signature-1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Fleabitdog||09-15-2001||09:15 PM||||Hi Jen, I will be there also. If you need anything give me a yell. Dave||||reg||1
Z||000003||Joe Torma||09-16-2001||01:24 AM||||Oohh...I'll be there.<P>Did # 1 & 2 on your list there....never rebuilt a headlight motor...so I choose 3.||||reg||1
Z||000004||kslish||09-16-2001||02:38 AM||||Holy cow Jen, your family hosts more events than some Fiero clubs!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <P>I'm going to see if I can make it this time (since I missed the BBQ) and I vote for #2 since I have done the other 2 and I don't have too much of a clue about working on the AC.  <P><P>------------------<BR>Ken S.<BR>'87GT and '86SC<BR>See them at <A HREF="http://homepage.mac.com/kjslish/Fiero.html" TARGET=_blank>http://homepage.mac.com/kjslish/Fiero.html</A><BR>Western PA Fiero Club - <A HREF="http://www.westpennfiero.org" TARGET=_blank>www.westpennfiero.org</A>||||reg||1
Z||000005||Fierochic88||09-16-2001||01:05 PM||||Dave, Vonnie & Fleabit -<P>Any preferences on which topic for the tech session?  Glad you guys can make it!<P>Jennifer<P><P>------------------<BR>IM Username:  FieroChic88<BR>Silver 1988 GT<BR>Silver 1986 2m4<BR>Cobalt Blue 85 GT<P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.webjolt.f2s.com/pictures/jenscar-sig1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
