Z||000017||Fierochic88||09-17-2001||10:05 PM||||Hi Everyone!  <BR>   Thanks for the great response so far!  17 people have already signed up and I'm hoping we will still see a few more!  So far the votes are looking like this:<BR> <BR>Headliner Removal :  4 votes (some people couldn't decide between 2!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> )<BR> <BR>AC Conversion:  3.5 Votes <BR> <BR>Headlight removal:  3 Votes<BR> <BR>   Of the people that responded Dave Horst, Dave Berkey, Nate Delp & Bruce Walters didn't tell me their preferences.  So if you are one of those people, or you are someone new signing up please let me know!  We would like to decide on a topic by the end of this week!<BR> <BR>   Also, I forgot to mention a few important things:<BR> <BR> - Bob Schlag has added this to the FieroPride website.  On there you will find directions from most major roadways.  If you have any questions or need different directions please contact me!<BR> <BR>- Also, please forward this along to get more people interested!  If anyone is a subscriber to the Fiero.org list or Fiero.net (whatever the lists are called) could you post it on there?<BR> <BR>-  Most importantly!  Lunch!  Like last year we plan on doing a potluck arrangement.  Please contact me ASAP with what you would like to bring!  Though I know Bob Ricci already has dibs on Bagels! Nothing else is spoken for as of this point!<BR> <BR>- We will plan on getting started around 8 or 9 in the AM.  I have to check what time we started last year and also, it will depend on the topic.<BR> <BR>-  I'm sure I will remember more things, so I'll keep everyone posted!<BR> <BR>Jennifer<P>||||reg||1
